eral election on economic and fiscal policy.","source":{"title":"Karen Bradley: About Karen","url":"https://www.karenbradley.co.uk/about-karen"}},{"phase":"career","start":"2004","end":"2007","title":"Fiscal and economic consultant","organisation":null,"detail":"In 2004 she became a self employed fiscal and economic consultant.","source":{"title":"GOV.UK: Karen Bradley MP","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/karen-bradley"}},{"phase":"career","start":"2007","end":"2010","title":"Rejoined KPMG","organisation":"KPMG","detail":"She rejoined KPMG in 2007 and remained there until her election in 2010.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Dame Karen Bradley","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/dame-karen-bradley/"}},{"phase":"politics","start":"2005","end":"2005","title":"Conservative candidate for Manchester Withington","organisation":"Conservative Party","detail":"She contested Manchester Withington at the 2005 general election and came third.","source":{"title":"GOV.UK: Karen Bradley MP","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/karen-bradley"}},{"phase":"politics","start":null,"end":null,"title":"A List candidate","organisation":"Conservative Party","detail":"She was added to the Conservative A List of prospective parliamentary candidates in the 2005 to 2010 Parliament.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Dame Karen Bradley","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/dame-karen-bradley/"}},{"phase":"politics","start":"2006-07","end":"2006-07","title":"Selected as candidate for Staffordshire Moorlands","organisation":"Conservative Party","detail":"She was selected for Staffordshire Moorlands in July 2006.","source":{"title":"GOV.UK: Karen Bradley MP","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/karen-bradley"}}]$bt$::jsonb),
